      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "A missingness flag on source_id is a plausible data-quality signal for decline risk and gives a groupable axis. Values are directly derivable from presence/absence of source_id, so groundedness is high. Usefulness is moderate: it is a generic missingness flag whose link to declines is speculative rather than established."
